-- Re-analysing an import batch drops issues that no longer apply (endpoints.md §5). Issues are working data
-- regenerated by each analysis, not audit data, so rule 6 (no hard deletes) does not cover them. The
-- tenant_isolation policy (FOR ALL) also limits DELETE to the firm and the clients the context sees.
-- Custom migration: Drizzle Kit does not model grants.
GRANT DELETE ON "import_issue" TO canopy_app;
